AWS CODE ARTIFACT:
=====================
- SOFTWARE PACKAGES DEPEND ON EACH OTHER TO BUILD
- STORING AND RETRIEVING THESE DEPENDENCIES IS CALLED ARTIFACT MANAGEMENT 
- TRADITIONALLY WE NEED TO SETUP OWN ARTIFACT MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
- CODE ARTIFICAT IS SECURE,SCALABLE AND COST EFFECTIVE ARTIFACT MANAGEMENT FOR SOFTWARE DEVELOPEMENT
- WORKS WITH COMMON DEPENDENCIY MANAGEMENT TOOLS SUCH AS AVEN,GRADLE,,,,


CODE ARTIFACT DOMAIN [LIBRARY BUILDIG]
========================================
- DOMAIN IS THE TOP-TIER CONTAINER.IT CONTAINS MULTIPLE PACKAGE REPOSITORIES
- IT STORES THE ACTUAL FILES AND HANDLES THE BILL

CODE ARTIFACT REPOSITORIES:
===========================
- A REPOSITORY IS WHERE DEVELOPERS ACTUALLY GO TO GET THEIR CODE
- THE PURPOE IT PROVIDES A URL(ENDPOINT) THAT OUR TOOLS (LIKE NPM,MAVEN,PYTHON) USE TO DOWNLOAD OR UPLOAD PACKAGES.
- A SINGLE REPO HOLDS DIFF TYPES OF PACKAGES(EXAPLE: .JS, PYTHON IN SAME PLACE)

IN REAL TIME,
 - WE WORKED IN ABC TECH MAKES BOTH WEBSITE AND MOBILE APP
DOMAIN: ABC-STORAGE( BIG BUCKET FOR WHOLE COMPANY)
REPOSITORY A: MOBILE-REPO (LIST OF CODE FOR PHONE APP)
REPOSITORY B: WEB-REPO    (LIST OF CODE FOR WEBSITE)

- IN BOTH WEBSITE&MOBILE APP USE SAME "LOGIN BUTTON" CODE, CODE ARTIFACT ONLY STORES ON COPY OF THAT CODE IN DOMAIN. TWO DIFF REPO'S JUST POINT THAT ONE COPY. THIS KEEPS ORGANIZED FOR THE TEAMS WHILE SAVE MONEY.
- REPOSITORIES NOT CONTAINS PACKAGES. IT CONTAINS ONLY PATH(END POINTS) OF WHERE PACKAGES WILL BE STORED(IN DOMAIN)P
  


